What Disabilities Have a Limited Pay Period Under Your Plan? 

We will pay disability benefits on a limited basis for a disability caused by, or contributed to by, any one or more of the following conditions: 

• Disabilities due in whole or in part to Mental Disorder have a maximum pay period of 24 months (from the date LTD begins) during your lifetime. 
• Disabilities due in whole or in part ten to Substance Abuse (alcohol abuse, drug abuse or dependency) have a limited pay period of 24 months (for the date LTD begins) during the lifetime.
We will not pay Monthly Benefits beyond the Maximum Period of Payment.
Exceptions
